{#- The hostelgames logo of every game page: a luggage tag with the one-line word mark
    (card as O, die as A; logomark-line.njk), hanging on a string from the top edge of the
    page. A small "by" sticks on the tag's top-left edge, half over the outline. Links to the
    hub start page (hostelgames.com, in the page's language if the hub has it). Colours follow
    the header (light / dark). Placed by sitehead.njk: next to the game's name on wide
    screens, top left on phones. -#}
<a class="gamelogo" href="{{ site.hubUrl(lang.code) }}" aria-label="by hostelgames">
  <svg class="logo" viewBox="0 0 922 148" aria-hidden="true">
    <path class="logo-tag" d="M66 4h844a12 12 0 0 1 12 12v116a12 12 0 0 1-12 12H66L8 74z"/>
    <circle class="logo-hole" cx="40" cy="74" r="9"/>
    <g transform="translate(74 12)">{% include "logomark-line.njk" %}</g>
  </svg>
  <span class="gameby" aria-hidden="true">by</span>
</a>
